 "description": "Use this when someone asks how to brew a teas.co.uk product, about its caffeine, taste, ingredients or allergy advice, or wants its full details. id is the product id (SKU) from find_products, compare_products or the basket, in any letter case. The numeric product id, the barcode or a teas.co.uk/product/ link also work. A product name does not, so search with find_products first. An unknown id, or a product no longer sold, returns an error instead of a guess. Price and stock are read live on each call. To set products side by side use compare_products.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "id": {
    "description": "Product id from find_products, or a teas.co.uk product link.",
    "maxLength": 300,
    "minLength": 1,
    "type": "string"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "id"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
